:: Carter Hang Out Go To Park [nobr]

/* Intro */
You ask <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> if he wants to go to the park and the small boy smiles wide. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Of course! The park is super cool! They have this HUGE jungle gym that you can climb and jump off of, since there are no teachers to stop us. Though we should be careful, since I didn’t bring my med kit. Oh, they also have a bunch of fields and stuff. We can run around and play superheroes! I also like to go there on weekends sometimes and clean up the trash people leave, keep the place looking as pretty as ever and-”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> pauses, <span style="color:LightGreen">seeing your raised eyebrow and smirk and realizing he had been rambling on.</span> <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Sorry, haha.”</span> He laughs nervously, blushing, <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Just got a little excited.”</span><br>

<<set _ad to [
	{
		Name: "Carter",
		State: {
            Outfit: $HangOutClothes,
			Mouth: "Happy",
            Blush: 1,
		},
	},
	{
		Name: "Player",
		State: {
			Mouth: "Smirk",
            Eyes: "Tired",
		},
	},
]>>
<<ad _ad>>

<div id="choice">
	<<link "Call him cute<br>">>
    <<replace"#choice">>
        <span style="Color: Pink">You laugh at <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span>, calling him cute. This causes him to blush even more.</span> <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“It- it’s not cute! It’s passion! A sense of duty!”</span> <span style="color:Pink">He says with puffed-up cheeks that just make him look even cuter.</span> You laugh and put your arm around him, stating that you weren’t insulting him. You like how cute AND passionate he is about things. It’s a pretty admirable quality. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Oh! Well… good!”</span> He laughs heroically, <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“But we don’t have to do any cleaning. I can do that later. We should just play.”</span><br>
        <br>
        [[Continue|Carter Hang Out Park]]
    <</replace>>
    <</link>>
	<<link "Mention how you plan to play rather than clean<br>">>
    <<replace"#choice">>
        You smirk at the boy and tell him that you were planning to play and hang out at the park rather than clean it. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“I- I know! I can do that stuff later; I’d rather play with you too! I just kinda… got distracted talking about it.”</span> He laughs nervously, rubbing the back of his head, <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Oh! What game should we play first? Or did you want to go on the swings or-”</span> <span style="color:LightGreen"> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> once again begins to ramble, which he keeps up until you arrive at the park.</span> <br>
        <br>
        [[Continue|Carter Hang Out Park]]
    <</replace>>
    <</link>>
</div>